  46:main.c        ****  *
  47:main.c        ****  * IMPORTANT:
  48:main.c        ****  *
  49:main.c        ****  * Coordinates are ZERO-BASED.
  50:main.c        ****  *
  51:main.c        ****  * Top-left cell = {0,0}
  52:main.c        ****  *
